{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
    "title": "人工维护的代码—依据关联种子",
    "summary": "定义并读取代码实现与需求、决策、研究及测试材料之间的人工关联；同步层可据此建立关系，但本模块不执行语义匹配或目标解析。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "authority",
        "title": "关系来源与用途",
        "body": "关联种子是代码 Fragment 与意图、决策、研究、测试依据之间的人工维护入口，不是自动语义匹配器。只有 JSON 中明确列出的条目才可在同步时转成评审关系；词面相似但未登记的命中不能成为 confirmed。数据放在仓库内的固定 JSON 文件中，TypeScript 模块负责声明并读取其形状。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "schema",
        "title": "种子结构与证据表达",
        "body": "每条种子用仓库相对代码路径和符号定位实现点，附带意图、需求标签、决策／研究／测试引用、关系状态以及解释实现关系的 evidence。需求引用只是标签，不直接作为 Fragment 目标；其他引用可使用 `path::anchor` 指向目标材料中的具体锚点。[[c2]] 该结构保留了代码定位、关系理由和外部依据的分工，但真正解析到 head 图与 Fragment 的工作不在本文件中。"
      },
      {
        "key": "loading",
        "title": "加载、容错与限制",
        "body": "文件缺失时加载器返回空列表，适用于新检出仓库或测试夹具；JSON 无法解析、根节点缺少 associations，或条目没有字符串形式的 codePath／symbol 时会抛错，避免损坏文件静默清空已有关系。[[c3]] 其余字段采用较宽松的默认值，尤其未知 status 会落为 confirmed；引用拆分也只按首个双冒号机械分割。[[c4]] 因而本层属于最小结构校验，不能替代同步阶段的 locator 解析、状态降级和交叉引用验证。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "人工关联种子的权威边界",
        "reason": "支持关联必须人工列举、不得由语义相似度自动确认及文件位置的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "/** Human-maintained seed associations between code fragments and the\n * intent / decision / research / test fragments that justify them.\n *\n * This is NOT an automatic semantic matcher: every entry is hand-curated and\n * must cite concrete requirement ids, decision docs, research docs and test\n * cases. The sync step "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "关联种子数据结构",
        "reason": "说明代码定位、意图、各类引用、状态和证据字段的职责。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 19,
          "endLine": 49
        },
        "quote": "/** A ref is a repo-relative path, optionally `path::anchor` where anchor is a\n * substring matched inside the target fragment (a requirement id, a test name,\n * a heading phrase). */\nexport type AssociationRef = string;\n\nexport type AssociationSeed = {\n  /** Code file repo-relative path, e.g. apps/server/src/assistant"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "关联文件加载与最小校验",
        "reason": "支持缺失文件返回空、损坏文件抛错及字段默认化的行为。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 51,
          "endLine": 89
        },
        "quote": "export function associationsPath(repoRoot: string): string {\n  return join(repoRoot, ASSOCIATIONS_DIR, ASSOCIATIONS_FILE);\n}\n\n/** Load and minimally validate the seed associations. Returns an empty list\n * when the file is absent (fresh checkouts / fixtures that supply their own).\n * Throws on malformed JSON so a broke"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "关联引用锚点拆分",
        "reason": "说明 path 与 anchor 仅按首个双冒号进行拆分。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 92,
          "endLine": 100
        },
        "quote": "/** Split \"path::anchor\" into its parts. */\nexport function parseRef(ref: AssociationRef): {\n  path: string;\n  anchor: string | null;\n} {\n  const idx = ref.indexOf(\"::\");\n  if (idx < 0) return { path: ref, anchor: null };\n  return { path: ref.slice(0, idx), anchor: ref.slice(idx + 2) };\n}"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "未知或拼写错误的 status 是否应当拒绝加载，而不是默认提升为 confirmed？",
        "why": "当前加载器仅识别 candidate 和 missing，其他任何值都会变成 confirmed；配置错误可能因此获得比原意更强的关系状态。",
        "nextStep": "在 associations 文件合同中加入严格枚举校验，并为非法状态补充失败测试；在确定兼容策略前保留现有行为说明。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
